# rp2350-touch-lcd-154-platform

The Waveshare RP2350-Touch-LCD-1.54 composite board and the three board-owned
providers it binds: an ST7789 colour panel, a CST816 touch controller, and a
QMI8658 inertial sensor.

Each provider owns its own wiring and nothing else. The device drivers are
portable modules under modules/mm, and the board is the only place that knows
which pin is which.
